2026-09-25T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-2255) 'an SSH tunnel to Bao for Bao-signed certificates
 # uuid: 74ed821d-4d38-5cdd-8250-31960548d776
 # tags: rfd:title
 RFD:Committed  1 RFD
 Serials:VSekaiFabric

2026-09-25T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-2255) 'A desk with no tailnet and no private-network peer reaches Bao's listener through sshd on the Bao machine, using a one-hour SSH certificate that Bao itself signs
 # tags: rfd:feature, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2255) '`service-openbao` (`sshd_config`, `Dockerfile.fdb`, `entrypoint-fdb.sh`, `fly.toml`), and Bao's `ssh/` mount, `ssh/roles/bao-tunnel` and the `ssh-bao-tunnel` policy
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2255) 'A desk with no tailnet reaches Bao through sshd, with a one-hour certificate Bao signs.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2255) 'Bao is reached over the tailnet or the private network, and a desk can lack both: a WSL distro is on neither, and its WireGuard peer fails to add its route.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2255) 'Follow the steps under Using it below to open the tunnel.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2255) 'an SSH tunnel to Bao for Bao-signed certificates
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2255) 'The Bao machine runs sshd on port 2222. It trusts one user CA, the key of Bao's own `ssh/` engine, and accepts one principal, `tunnel`. That user has no shell and may forward only to `127.0.0.1:8200`. An agent signs its SSH key with its Bao token at `ssh/sign/bao-tunnel`, gets a certificate valid for an hour, and runs `ssh -N -L` to the listener. The listener's mTLS stays the second factor: the tunnel carries TLS, it does not replace it.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2255) '- RFD66606-2195 (Bao over the tailnet), the path this complements.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2255) 'Related RFDs
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2255) '- RFD66606-2146 (Bao is the secret store), the cert-auth identities that sign here.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2255) '- RFD66606-2142 (Bao PKI), the root the agent certificates chain to.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2255) 'Using it
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2255) 'With a Bao token from cert login (RFD66606-2195's four variables):
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2255) '    ssh-keygen -y -f key.pem > key.pub
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2255) '    bao write -field=signed_key ssh/sign/bao-tunnel \
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2255) '        public_key=@key.pub valid_principals=tunnel > key-cert.pub
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2255) '    ssh -N -L 18200:127.0.0.1:8200 -p 2222 \
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2255) '        -i key.pem -o CertificateFile=key-cert.pub tunnel@<bao address>
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2255) '    export BAO_ADDR=https://127.0.0.1:18200
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2255) '    export BAO_TLS_SERVER_NAME=weftspun-bao.internal
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-2255) 'The key can be the same P-256 key as the agent's cert-auth identity, converted to PKCS#8, so a desk holds one private key.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-2255) 'What is measured
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2255  1 LINE
 Text:Written

